# `Bridges.PosetTheory.StoneWeierstrassLattice` (recovered stub)

The file that used to sit at this path did not contain Lean code: it held a
multiply-nested `diff` (a patch of a patch of a patch …) of a file
`EML/StoneWeierstrassLattice.lean` that is not present in this repository, so the
module could never be elaborated.  The raw text has been preserved next to this
file as `StoneWeierstrassLattice.lean.corrupted-diff.txt`; it is too badly
interleaved (five nesting levels, with conflicting versions of the same
declarations) to be reconstructed faithfully, so no mathematical content is
asserted here.

The scalar Stone–Weierstrass material that this module was meant to provide is
available in Mathlib (`ContinuousMap.starAlgHom_apply`, `ContinuousMap.eq_top_of_separatesPoints`),
and a vector-valued extension lives in `Bridges.HilbertSpace.VectorStoneWeierstrass`.
-/